{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_218_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_218","textTraditional":"一、六年。春王正月癸亥，鄭游遬帥師滅許，以許男斯歸。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_218_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_218","textTraditional":"二、二月，公侵鄭。公至自侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_218_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_218","textTraditional":"三、夏，季孫斯、仲孫何忌如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_218_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_218","textTraditional":"四、秋，晉人執宋行人樂祁犁。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_218_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_218","textTraditional":"五、冬，城中城。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_218_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_218","textTraditional":"六、季孫斯、仲孫忌帥師圍運。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_218_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_218","textTraditional":"此仲孫何忌也，曷為謂之仲孫忌？譏二名。二名，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}